00386B  1  A4 95                LDY     Cvaral          ; get var address low byte
00386D  1  A5 96                LDA     Cvarah          ; get var address high byte
00386F  1  4C 28 28             JMP     LAB_AYFC        ; save and convert integer AY to FAC1 and return
